    {
      "key": "TUT_ADDON_THAUMICEXPLORATION",
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "thaumicexploration:tut_addon_thaumicexploration/text/1",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicexploration.tut_addon_thaumicexploration.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "神秘探险是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicexploration:tut_addon_thaumicexploration/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicexploration.tut_addon_thaumicexploration.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "神秘探险提供了大量"
                },
                {
                  "text": "功能独立的小装置",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "：省魔力的指环、永不干涸的水壶、方块复制器、流星之靴、新的杖端和杖柄，以及三种新的注魔附魔。\n它的研究在"
                },
                {
                  "text": "秘术学",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "分页中，分页里放有原版研究的镜像，方便你看清前后关系。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicexploration:tut_addon_thaumicexploration/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicexploration:tut_addon_thaumicexploration/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicexploration.tut_addon_thaumicexploration.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "推荐顺序\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicexploration:tut_addon_thaumicexploration/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.thaumicexploration.tut_addon_thaumicexploration.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicexploration:DISCOUNTRINGS"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：碎片指环，降低某种魔力的消耗，前期就能做。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicexploration:URN"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：无尽之壶，无限水源。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicexploration:METEORBOOTS"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：流星之靴，冲刺与下砸。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicexploration:REPLICATOR"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：神秘复制器，用源质复制方块。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "thaumicexploration:CAP_SOJOURNER"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：索杰纳杖端，会自动缓慢充能。\n大部分内容需要"
                },
                {
                  "research": "TUT_INFUSION_RUN"
                },
                {
                  "text": "。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thaumicexploration:tut_addon_thaumicexploration/recommended/divider",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
